Copyright in original NullOS and NullKernel code remains with its respective copyright holder.

**Copyright © 2026 Haitham Al-Nasser**

Copyright in genuinely new code written by contributors remains with its respective author, subject to this license when that code is distributed as part of a Derived Version.

