## 15. Acceptance and Severability

By distributing NullOS-covered code or a Derived Version subject to this license, the distributor agrees to comply with the conditions of this license.

If any provision of this license is found unenforceable under applicable law, the remaining provisions shall remain in effect to the extent permitted by applicable law.

